      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "感觉好像看到了总是沉着冷静的\n目白阿尔丹令人意外的一面，\n让我也跟着开心起来。",
      "source_fingerprint": "df174d3b94912302d7e43330196a46692c8ab3c76f164f2de83e552165016757",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
